Output settings: paste method, clipboard handling, automatic submit, delays, typing tool

Usage: handy settings output [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  get   Print the output settings, or only KEY
  set   Change one output setting; with --dry-run, validate and preview without writing
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json  Print exactly one JSON envelope on stdout (also accepted before `settings`)
  -h, --help  Print help
